# ==============================================================================
# Apolo Music Bot — .gitignore
# Combined template: Gradle + Java + Spring Boot (+ IDEs / OS / security)
# NOTE: `src/main/resources/application.properties` is intentionally TRACKED
# (it only references ${DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN}), so application.properties/yml
# patterns are deliberately NOT ignored here.
# ==============================================================================

